### 🟢 LOW

#### 9. General Fixture (Over-broad Setup)
**Scope:** Class-level `[TestInitialize]` (line 13)
**Issue:** `_logger` is initialised in `Setup()` but **no test method references it**. Every test pays the allocation cost of a field it never uses.

```csharp
// ❌ _logger set up but never consumed
_logger = new FakeLogger();
```

**Fix — remove `_logger` from the fixture; add it only to tests that need it:**
```csharp
// Remove from fields + Setup(). In any future test:
var logger = new FakeLogger();
var processor = new OrderProcessor(_db, _email, _inventory, logger);
```

